{% llmparse('location_things_plan') as locationThingsPlan %}

The roster has been validated. Expand exactly these approved entries, keeping every name, item/scenery kind, and rarity unchanged. Do not add, omit, duplicate, combine, or rename entries. Expand the one-sentence descriptions into full descriptions and supply all required mechanics and registered fields.
<approvedThingsPlan>
{% for entry in locationThingsPlan %}<item><name>{{ entry.name | escape }}</name><itemOrScenery>{{ entry.itemOrScenery | escape }}</itemOrScenery><rarity>{{ entry.rarity | escape }}</rarity><description>{{ entry.description | escape }}</description></item>
{% endfor %}</approvedThingsPlan>

